1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,167
What time is Jama’at at a nearby mosque? DiscoverSalah makes that easier to find.

2
00:00:07,167 --> 00:00:14,500
A community-maintained website for actual congregation times at participating mosques.

3
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:19,917
The beginning of a prayer time is different from the start of congregation.

4
00:00:19,917 --> 00:00:28,292
No account needed. Choose an area or location, then browse timetables and notices.

5
00:00:28,292 --> 00:00:37,167
Open Google Maps for directions. DiscoverSalah provides no travel-time estimate or arrival guarantee.

6
00:00:37,167 --> 00:00:44,500
Report incorrect information, suggest a mosque, or apply to contribute.

7
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:52,500
Track your request privately. Reports never automatically change approved timings.

8
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:58,833
The local representative maintains mosque information and submits timing changes.

9
00:00:58,833 --> 00:01:03,958
The focal person reviews changes after contacting the registered Imam.

10
00:01:03,958 --> 00:01:11,583
The administrator manages areas, staff and assignments. Each role has a defined scope.

11
00:01:11,583 --> 00:01:18,125
A submitted change receives independent review with recorded Imam-call evidence.

12
00:01:18,125 --> 00:01:25,875
The reviewer approves, returns or rejects it. Nobody can approve their own submission.

13
00:01:25,875 --> 00:01:31,292
Future-approved timings become effective on their scheduled date.

14
00:01:31,292 --> 00:01:40,167
Staff sign in; administrators use MFA. Private Imam contacts stay off public pages.

15
00:01:40,167 --> 00:01:47,417
React, Node and Express, and MongoDB connect the interface, workflows and stored records.

16
00:01:47,417 --> 00:01:54,875
DiscoverSalah works locally. Public deployment is still being prepared.

17
00:01:54,875 --> 00:02:00,958
Free pilot hosting, scheduled notifications, backups and final checks remain.

18
00:02:00,958 --> 00:02:09,083
DiscoverSalah. Local Jama’at times, community participation and clear verification.
